---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="relative z-10 mt-24 border-t border-[color:var(--color-border)]">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        <span class="text-[color:var(--color-heading)]">inter<span class="gradient-text">synth</span></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">Lab</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">
        InterSynth.ai is one of the nine open and interdisciplinary research environments in WASP-HS.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-medium text-[color:var(--color-heading)]">Explore</h4>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">
        <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-heading)]">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/research" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-heading)]">Research</a></li>
        <li><a href="/people" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-heading)]">People</a></li>
        <li><a href="/publications" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-heading)]">Publications</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-medium text-[color:var(--color-heading)]">Funding</h4>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">
        Part of 
        <a href="https://wasp-hs.org/synthetic-data-facts-representations-and-transparency/" class="underline decoration-dotted hover:text-[color:var(--color-heading)]" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WASP-HS</a>
        and supported by the Wallenberg Foundations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-[color:var(--color-border)]">
    <div class="container-page flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-2 py-5 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-muted)] sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <span>© {year} InterSynth Lab</span>
      <span class="font-mono">Linköping · Södertörn · Uppsala · Lund</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
